# Searing Gorge - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in Searing Gorge,
# verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever item drop
# tables). All nine are mob drops with sole droppers spawning in-zone (two
# Cindercloth patterns share one dropper, so one step carries both). No
# recipe is sold by any in-zone vendor. Everything else Searing-Gorge-
# dropping is a generic multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule, argued per case
# in the inventory — including the Dark Iron Shoulders, which names
# in-zone Anvilrage droppers among 14, and the 228xxx endgame world-boss
# series, which names in-zone droppers among world bosses), one narrow
# formula belongs to a Badlands-family mob with a single incidental Gorge
# point, and quest records carry no reward data, so neither ships (see
# docs/searing-gorge-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Cooking, Enchanting, First
# Aid and Fishing have no Searing Gorge source, so that is stated, not
# padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/searing-gorge-recipes
title Searing Gorge - Recipes & Patterns
levels 40-52
zone Searing Gorge
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords searing gorge, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Twilight cultists - cindercloth (Tailoring)

  zone map 1427

  when skill Tailoring 1

  loop
  goto 14.42,38.73
  goto 16.00,33.39
  goto 16.70,33.82
  goto 16.80,44.61
  goto 17.54,43.84
  goto 18.09,35.57
  goto 18.53,36.89
  goto 19.21,37.06
  goto 19.65,38.60
  goto 20.81,35.85
  kill 5861 optional
  collect 14471 "Pattern: Cindercloth Vest" optional
  collect 14476 "Pattern: Cindercloth Gloves" optional
  note The Twilight Fire Guard is the sole dropper anywhere in the data for both patterns and spawns only in Searing Gorge. No quest takes them.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

